    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb0b1b11aea3d973e7cc0951",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "劲敌们也来到赛场齐聚一堂。\n多亏有她们以及训练员，\n第一红宝石才能登上更高的境界。",
      "source_fingerprint": "52b5bcd62ef2c3b25abc6b4952ff22c2bbe1c4982cb7fc10e8179e80ed588e9a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085417.json",
      "json_path": [
