    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99019732887142f27b6588f7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "至高舞台已准备就绪。\n第一红宝石对训练员表达感谢后便迈向赛场。\n为了绽放最耀眼的光芒，此刻她将华丽冲刺──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "95b3677f176a272890fe7c6c165dda915a095d339f9a169289121470f7f21dc4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085417.json",
