    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7729b7f1e9eb62135b4917b5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "第一红宝石跑出了冲击性的精彩出道战。\n记者会上，记者们抛出了许多期待的言语，\n而她也宣告必将不负期待。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8f066e979379526c487a9e4586dd43d803d89b8fc9ae31bd0b321b1b45a966f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
