      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:063ef6d3d5ce17f72e53d1fd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她提议调整行程，让状态在三后冠路线时\n到达最高峰，训练员也赞成此方案，\n而将下一个目标订为“赛马娘赛”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "de7bb225bfe1f1109e659b950ee60e43c03387f5dfb094e60841830361666505",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
