      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "凯斯奇迹在此时来访，\n她很为室友第一红宝石着想，特地前来告知\n收到许多寄给第一红宝石的包裹。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e55e69d996916cb609fe6d9255e8bd7d1dee7aef26fba774804b3c841e5afd7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af92e9511c767c2082392c8c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
