    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:405569441216ea22e626a1af",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目标就决定是“赛马娘赛”了。\n不过第一红宝石实在聪慧过人，\n令训练员觉得自己有点没用。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5b4104950e1d926ff523646ca94aa723deda82c61d589a80fec65b23f80e875",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
