      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "第一红宝石彻底展示了实力。\n观众们为之沸腾，无不期待\n看到她称霸三后冠的那一刻。",
      "source_fingerprint": "af2b4cc4c41c78757a84df44c9c4aeb9aa3cc23757aef61e3bdcf9772aae8b01",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
