      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员回顾她的表现。\n她的跑速快得有如闪光，\n在短距离赛应该也能大显身手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cf84e2ea778b49ba20a52f1f18416f187d8e3d1a30ec17af0a507548ea88afc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
