    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cd156dc679dcc7c54de3080",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无论如何，接下来就是三后冠的第一战，\n也就是她母亲曾经称霸的“樱花赏”。\n第一红宝石必须扛着更沉重的压力前往挑战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a413c8e4b4b59fc546ec9648136e38cddf200815bdc675d8c485f7c8cba0d6cf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
