      "source_text": "训练员已确定第一红宝石的资质偏向短距离赛。\n他开始烦恼该让她充分活用才能奔跑，\n还是该尊重她的意愿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "57ab42fd93a82f7789b5da5d11fe1bb8b617a73af8a368ebcede6c8c315479fb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085423.json",
