      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在与大拓太阳神的激烈对决后，\n第一红宝石赢得“高松宫纪念”，\n达成“华丽一族”三代称霸的伟业。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3ecfb1c93fac1062082fafa3f9370d1db80aa644bb1db56e2dbffce9579fde7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
