    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5285e0a79a113bf371e48a15",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "赛后，第一红宝石对大拓太阳神的速度表示认可。\n她期待着往后仍能与这位劲敌\n互相切磋并且精进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1eb342f7d539ce74d931baea1b39e68dfe73f7147fa2ad1b241e713f18961a94",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
