    {
      "uid": "zhcn:128b40b0307b53fa36b4202b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "下一场目标竞赛就决定是“安田纪念”了。\n两人立即开始为了新的目标动身准备。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab01942cd999927d0f0c0a73035b088a991131b466c2fad66910107012fd6996",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
